      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُصْرِدٌ</span></b> , (Ktr, L,) or ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُصْرَدٌ</span></b> , (so accord. to the
